996 0 obj
  << /ActualText (RunPal is a wrist\055worn running companion built around an Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense and a 1\05651\042\ntransparent OLED display\056 A pixel\055art cat character animates in real time to reflect your running state\n\024 sitting idle while waiting\054 counting down\054 sprinting alongside you during a run\054 and panting on the\nsummary screen\056 Runs are started and stopped entirely by voice using an on\055device TFLite machine\nlearning model trained with Edge Impulse to recognise the keywords \042Hey Ajax\042 and \042Stop run\042 \024 no\nphone or internet required\056 A passive buzzer provides audio feedback at the start and end of each run\056\nThe system is housed in a custom 3D\055printed watch case designed to fit a standard 20mm watch\nstrap\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 997 0 R
     /Pg 956 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

